      "text": "Omni-Channel readiness concerns routing work to an agent. Salesforce states that later field changes do not reapply routing logic. External routing exposes work-acceptance, decline and completion notifications, but those milestones do not establish coverage of every Case lifecycle change. Treat routing readiness and alert delivery as separate checks. A historical Case routing-error report illustrates why a visible Case status alone does not prove routing succeeded. The forum observation remains attributed and does not establish a current defect.",
